WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.260
This is how much I spent for
lunch at Universal Studios.

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:04.480
I ate a Krusty Burger.

00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:07.020
It's a cute Simpsons
restaurant in the park.

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:09.840
To start things off, of course
I had to get a Krusty Burger.

00:00:10.020 --> 00:00:11.340
That was $13.99.

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:13.120
I also got a bottle of water.

00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:14.260
That was $4.

00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:18.640
To top things off, I got a
chocolate shake, and that was $6.50.

00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:22.440
All of this together for
a grand total of $26.82.

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:23.680
Cheers!
